        <short-description type="string">On-screen checklist whose lines turn green as you set each control.</short-description>
        <long-description type="string">Shows the aircraft's checklist in flight (Ctrl-K). Lines tied to a control or gauge go green by themselves when it is set, and show the control's live state; other lines are ticked with a click. Its tied checklists also colour Help > Aircraft Checklists.</long-description>
